    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Olderiada:\u00a0Constellation Of Fables</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Olderiada is a funny, light, fantasy battler with strategy/action/RPG elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a trickster leader. Train your troops, lead them into battle, complete quests, and expand your kingdom. Fight on open fields or besiege enemy castles. Win not by numbers, but through cunning and perfect timing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unconventional heroes:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oldiery \u2014 an unpredictable trickster whose cunning beats brute strength every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sparrowiery \u2014 once an ordinary sparrow, lifted by ferocious ambition; now an elusive phantom, master of tricks and an unrivaled strategist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marquis de Hog \u2014\u00a0is not just a walking treasury. He is armed with a <strong>unique weapon</strong> of his own creation: a bizarre hybrid between an aristocratic cane and a deadly mechanical needle. Rumors speak of it containing hidden mechanisms and being enchanted by forgotten artisans. Its elegance is matched only by its lethality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432560/extras/59961497a170bfecf5a5ba0bd5ee14bb.avif?t=1752784054\" width=600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sir Rubin de Rhomb \u2014\u00a0noble yet haunted, driven by a broken heart, a genius tactician whose dusk-gray blade bends fate with every measured strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestina Lisveil \u2014 the Vixen of the Three Moons Tower. A dazzling warrior in checkered armor, brilliantly cunning, she knows the world\u2019s secrets and predicts enemy moves as if playing a game with fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that's only the beginning. Dozens of unique heroes await, each with their own backstory, skills, and tactical role.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A colorful fantasy world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>Olderiada</i> is part fairytale, part surreal dream. From glowing fields to cursed swamps, mountaintop castles to underground ruins \u2014 every zone is alive with secrets and story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step in, uncover the hidden, and leave your mark on a world unlike any other.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Olderiada:\u00a0Constellation Of Fables</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Olderiada is a funny, light, fantasy battler with strategy/action/RPG elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a trickster leader. Train your troops, lead them into battle, complete quests, and expand your kingdom. Fight on open fields or besiege enemy castles. Win not by numbers, but through cunning and perfect timing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unconventional heroes:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oldiery \u2014 an unpredictable trickster whose cunning beats brute strength every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sparrowiery \u2014 once an ordinary sparrow, lifted by ferocious ambition; now an elusive phantom, master of tricks and an unrivaled strategist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marquis de Hog \u2014\u00a0is not just a walking treasury. He is armed with a <strong>unique weapon</strong> of his own creation: a bizarre hybrid between an aristocratic cane and a deadly mechanical needle. Rumors speak of it containing hidden mechanisms and being enchanted by forgotten artisans. Its elegance is matched only by its lethality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432560/extras/59961497a170bfecf5a5ba0bd5ee14bb.avif?t=1752784054\" width=600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sir Rubin de Rhomb \u2014\u00a0noble yet haunted, driven by a broken heart, a genius tactician whose dusk-gray blade bends fate with every measured strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestina Lisveil \u2014 the Vixen of the Three Moons Tower. A dazzling warrior in checkered armor, brilliantly cunning, she knows the world\u2019s secrets and predicts enemy moves as if playing a game with fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that's only the beginning. Dozens of unique heroes await, each with their own backstory, skills, and tactical role.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A colorful fantasy world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>Olderiada</i> is part fairytale, part surreal dream. From glowing fields to cursed swamps, mountaintop castles to underground ruins \u2014 every zone is alive with secrets and story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step in, uncover the hidden, and leave your mark on a world unlike any other.</p>",
